www.alorawellness.co.nz<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Alora Wellness | Nurturing Mind & Body</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4a5d4e; /* Calming Sage */
            --primary-light: #f4f6f4;
            --accent: #bfa38a; /* Warm Earth */
            --text: #2c3531;
            --bg: #faf9f6; /* Soft White */
        }
        
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background-color: transparent;
            padding: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 2rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .hero {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 400;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            color: #606662;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .cta-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: background 0.3s ease;
        }

        .cta-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent);
        }

        .services {
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
            padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .services h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .contact {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 5rem auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact h2 {
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 400;
        }

        .contact-info {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #8c928e;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e8e6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">Alora Wellness</div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Restore Balance to Your Life</h1>
        <p>A peaceful space dedicated to holistic well-being, healing treatments, and mindful restoration tailored perfectly for you.</p>
        <a href="#contact" class="cta-btn">Connect With Us</a>
    </section>

    <section class="services">
        <h2>Our Offerings</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Holistic Therapy</h3>
                <p>Gentle, restorative sessions designed to bring peace to a busy mind and realign your inner energy.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Body Wellness</h3>
                <p>Therapeutic treatments focusing on physical rejuvenation, releasing deep-held tension and stress.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Mindful Consultation</h3>
                <p>One-on-one sessions to help you develop lifestyle practices that support lasting health and clarity.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="contact">
        <h2>Begin Your Journey</h2>
        <p>We would love to welcome you to our community. Reach out today to discuss how we can assist in your wellness goals.</p>
        <div class="contact-info">
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> hello@alorawellness.co.nz</p>
            <p><strong>Location:</strong> Riverhead, New Zealand</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Alora Wellness. Created with care.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
